@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed artifact availability, protection and reclamation facts
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Reserve bounded growth under current policy;
:Stage privately and validate actual bytes;
if (Usable artifact confirmed?) then (yes)
 :Finalize actual accounting / usability;
else (no / unknown)
 :Retain actual residual / unknown state;\nreconcile before release or reuse;
 stop
endif
:Protect exact references before consumer commit;\nfinalize using actual consumer evidence;
note right
 Replacement admits new bytes first.
 Failed switch preserves prior usable association.
 Lost acknowledgment retains protection.
end note
:Retain while any publication, submission\nor other required reference remains;
if (Reviewed retirement eligible?) then (yes)
 :Guard against new protection;\nverify no required / pending references;
else (no)
 :Keep artifact protected / available as permitted;
 stop
endif
if (Deletion safely admitted?) then (yes)
 :Perform bounded physical reclamation attempt;
else (no)
 :Keep artifact; reconcile competing protection;
 stop
endif
if (Physical reclamation confirmed?) then (yes)
 :Release applicable accounting using actual evidence;
else (failed / unknown)
 :Retain residual / unknown state and accounting;\nreconcile same attempt;
endif
stop
@enduml
